# Ask OSE from your AI tools > Use it as an MCP server
For another client, put this in the client's configuration:

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "ose-knowledge": {
      "type": "stdio",
      "command": "uvx",
      "args": ["ose-knowledge-mcp==0.14.13"]
    }
  }
}
```

# Use internal virtual cards > Policy
OCE may use virtual cards only for:
recurring or one-off operating expenses of the Foundation;

